            <ArticleTitle>Setting up QI programs for pediatric specialty clinics.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>10-6, 27</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article reviews how to create a quality improvement (QI) reporting system for a multiple subspecialty pediatric clinic that is part of an acute pediatric facility in a major metropolitan area. The history of the facility, the needs of the organization, and areas that could be developed to create a comprehensive QI program are described. Examples of the data and format of QI studies are presented as well as future plans for continuing program development.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
